        Add a scene_image ModelTarget and a public OnnxSession (from_path/from_bytes, run_cpu, optional run_gpu, public Tensor) to Lege-ecosystem/lege-gpu. Path-depend that crate from raw-autotune behind the semantic Cargo feature. Existing OCR model targets must keep preparing. Do not add ort.
        """
