        Preserve the visually preferred `output-tests/20260809-191941-p0800/harmonic-spatial-chroma/` result as the tuning baseline. Do not treat aggregate saturation, green-deficit, or near-white metrics as sufficient promotion evidence when the sky topology is visibly wrong.
        """
